 📖 Surah 110 (Surah An-Nasr) se Related Ahadith

**(Roman Urdu – Sahih Bukhari & Sahih Muslim)**

---

## 1. Surah An-Nasr = Nabi ﷺ ki wafat ka ishara

**Hadith (Roman Urdu):**
Hazrat Ibn Abbas (RA) farmate hain:

Hazrat Umar (RA) mujhe baday sahaba ke saath bithate thay. Kuch logon ne poocha ke aap is jawan ko kyun bithate hain? To Umar (RA) ne un se Surah **“Iza jaa’a nasrullahi wal fath”** ka matlab poocha.

Kuch sahaba ne kaha: “Is mein humein hukm diya gaya hai ke jab Allah ki madad aur fatah aaye to Allah ki hamd aur istighfar karein.”

Ibn Abbas (RA) ne kaha:
“Yeh Surah Nabi ﷺ ki wafat ka ishara hai. Jab Allah ki madad aur fatah aa gayi, to yeh aap ﷺ ke mission ke complete hone ki nishani hai.”

Umar (RA) ne kaha: “Main bhi isi tarah samajhta hoon.”

**Reference:**
Sahih al-Bukhari 4970

---

### 🧠 Samajh (Roman Urdu)

* Surah An-Nasr sirf fatah ki khushi nahi
* Yeh **Nabi ﷺ ke mission ke complete hone ka signal** hai
* Is ke baad aap ﷺ ki wafat qareeb thi

---

## 2. Nabi ﷺ ka amal: Tasbeeh aur Istighfar

**Hadith (Roman Urdu):**
Hazrat Aisha (RA) farmati hain:

“Nabi ﷺ apni ruku aur sujood mein aksar yeh parhte thay:
‘Subhanaka Allahumma Rabbana wa bihamdika, Allahummaghfir li’
(Ya Allah! Tu paak hai, hum teri hamd karte hain, mujhe maaf farma).

Yeh is liye ke aap ﷺ Qur’an (Surah An-Nasr) par amal kar rahe thay.”

**Reference:**
Sahih al-Bukhari 817
Sahih Muslim 484

---

### 🧠 Samajh

* Surah An-Nasr mein hukm hai:
  **“Tasbeeh karo aur istighfar karo”**
* Nabi ﷺ ne is par practically amal kiya
* Humein bhi success ke baad **Allah ko yaad karna chahiye**, na ke ghuroor

---

## 3. Surah ke baad Nabi ﷺ ka zyada istighfar karna

**Hadith (Roman Urdu):**
Hazrat Aisha (RA) farmati hain:

“Jab se Surah ‘Iza jaa’a nasrullahi wal fath’ nazil hui, main ne Nabi ﷺ ko dekha ke aap ﷺ zyada se zyada yeh parhte:
‘Subhanallahi wa bihamdihi, astaghfirullaha wa atubu ilayh.’”

**Reference:**
Sahih Muslim 484

---

### 🧠 Samajh

* Nabi ﷺ ko jab fatah mili (Makkah ki), tab bhi aap ﷺ **aur zyada humble ho gaye**
* Is se lesson:
  👉 Success → Shukr + Istighfar
  👉 Na ke takabbur

---

## 🌿 Surah 110 ka Core Message

* Allah ki madad se fatah milti hai
* Jab success aaye →
  ✔ Tasbeeh (SubhanAllah)
  ✔ Hamd (Alhamdulillah)
  ✔ Istighfar (Astaghfirullah)
* Life ka end bhi yaad rakhna chahiye

---

## ✍️ Reflection

* Kya main success par Allah ko yaad karta/karti hoon?
* Kya main istighfar ko apni life ka hissa banaya hai?
* Kya main apni life ka purpose samajh raha/rahi hoon?

